  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-5708195-A", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "furthermore, via the communication unit 36, the leak information accumulator 82 accumulates the actual leak location and leak quantity obtained as a result of inspection and transmitted from the worker 40 who went to the actual spot, in the same way as the case other than earthquakes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, when the corrugated pipe body according to the present invention is composed of a unit corrugated pipe, it can provide excellent earthquake resistance, water leak prevention, shock absorption, and ease of maintenance compared to the existing corrugated pipe body"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5529803-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in particular, if water is drained when there is a lot of tap water consumption or when there is a water leak in the water pipeline due to an earthquake, etc., the water pressure in the water pipeline is likely to drop excessively"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the underground drain pipe connection unit according to the present invention can improve earthquake resistance and water leak prevention performance, providing a safe and comfortable living environment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100603985-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in the above method, as the manhole and the conveying pipe are fixedly installed by mortar, the mortar part is partially removed or cracks are leaked due to the crustal fluctuation such as a weak earthquake and the fatigue load caused by the vibration caused by the flow velocity"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5529803-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in particular, if water is drained when there is a lot of tap water consumption or when there is a water leak in the water pipeline due to an earthquake, etc., the water pressure in the water pipeline is likely to drop excessively"}, {"pat_id": "US-5708195-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in other words, the first conventional technique is premised on the existence of water leak and lacks the viewpoint that pipeline breakage should be sensed rapidly at the time of a disaster such as an earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "US-11905688-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "these movement sensors detect both movement and acceleration, which allows detection of earthquakes or other events that might correspond to a higher probability of a leak forming"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3906965-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "furthermore, if the aquarium itself is aged, the tank wall made of concrete may crack due to earthquakes and leak water"}]</data>
</edge>
