increased by the material decomposition and material binding action, so that the water stored in the reservoir is always kept at the full water level and water flowing from the upstream through the lower part of the sluice gate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101802534-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by maintaining the adsorbent material in the biological reactor 202 or other upstream of the membrane operating system 204, the suspended-media membrane biological reactor system minimizes the possibility of contamination and / or wear of the membrane operating system tank membrane by the adsorbent material, remove"}]</data>
