ovided to cover the opening of the water tank 10 to prevent the inflow of foreign matter and infiltration of bacteria in the air, the first cover 20 the space between the second cover 30 serves as a thermal insulation space to block the influence of the external temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101368425-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as such, the first cover 200 covers the opening of the water tank 100 to prevent the inflow of foreign substances and the penetration of bacteria in the air, and the space between the first cover 200 and the second cover 300 is it functions as an insulated space to block the influence of the outside temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "US-11325845-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "a blowdown temperature control loop may be initialized and an extra source valve command cap may be determined in block 8018 as well"}, {"pat_id": "US-11352267-B2", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "a blowdown temperature control loop may be initialized and an extra source valve command cap may be determined in block 8018 as well"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100886893-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water metering box protective casing cap is installed in a protective casing because it cannot block the ground temperature during the cold winter season"}]</data>
