  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-0161642-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, when a backflow occurs from the hot water storage tank 12 due to the breakage of the check valve 13, the temperature of the cold water of the cold water storage tank 10 is increased to be higher than the minimum cooling temperature"}, {"pat_id": "US-4510026-A", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "the current was cut off to avoid further increase of the temperature which would have resulted in breakage of the plastic cylinders after which a negative pressure was applied to the system with an ejector"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101454539-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "first, the offshore plant 100 according to the prior art resumes the operation of transferring marine resources, and as the temperature of the marine resources is rapidly lowered due to the row thompson effect, the pipeline 130 is damaged due to temperature drop there is a problem that there is a risk of breakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101454539-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "summary of the invention the present invention has been made to solve the above problems and it is an object of the present invention to provide a multiple pressure regulator for an offshore plant which can reduce the risk of damage or breakage of a pipeline due to a rapid temperature drop in the process of transferring marine resources"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101454539-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, the multiple pressure regulating device 1 for an offshore plant according to the present invention can reduce the risk of damage or breakage of the pipeline 40 due to a temperature drop, the effect of increasing the durability of the line 40 can be obtained"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101454539-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "summary of the invention the present invention has been made to solve the above problems and it is an object of the present invention to provide a multiple pressure regulator for an offshore plant which can reduce the risk of damage or breakage of a pipeline due to a rapid temperature drop in the process of transferring marine resources"}, {"pat_id": "US-9273801-B1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "this limits the movement (expansion and contraction due to temperature changes) of the pipe in area of service connection 8 thus preventing breakage or leaks in the service line (not shown) attached to service connection 8"}, {"pat_id": "US-9273801-B1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "this limits the movement (expansion and contraction due to temperature changes) of the pipe in area of service connection 8 thus preventing breakage or leaks in the service line (not shown) attached to service connection 8"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0161642-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, when a backflow occurs from the hot water storage tank 12 due to the breakage of the check valve 13, the temperature of the cold water of the cold water storage tank 10 is increased to be higher than the minimum cooling temperature"}, {"pat_id": "US-4204956-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by the provision of a quartz jacket about each uv lamp, the possibility of lamp breakage in the tank is materially reduced, and also the jackets provide for the lamps to be operated at desired temperatures for optimum radiation whatever the temperature of water passing through the system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0161642-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, when a backflow occurs from the hot water storage tank 12 due to the breakage of the check valve 13, the temperature of the cold water of the cold water storage tank 10 is increased to be higher than the minimum cooling temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101568929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101861841-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}]</data>
