d": "KR-102400040-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the water level of the treated water tank is measured in real time, and when the water level is out of a certain range, the gate valve is selectively opened and closed to block the flow path of the overflow pipe, thereby increasing the overflow height of the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200332116-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, when the water tank level is a high water level, the flow of water is blocked by the float 42 and the pressure valve 43, so that the current of the pump motor increases without being stabilized as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200442330-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically, when the purified water is filled to the water level set in the purified water storage tank (pressure tank), the automatic shut off valve for the water purification system can automatically block the inflow of raw water to the purified water filter due to the pressure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200359449-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, when the water level is above a certain level, the ball tower 30 floats due to the buoyancy of the water to block the water intake pipe 32"}]</data>
