ol unit for controlling driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump to transport the contaminated water to the land storage tank when the internal water level of the shielding facility is higher than a predetermined reference value, and the inside water level of the shielding facility can be adjusted by being transported in both directions between the storage tank and the polluted water storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, a pipeline is installed between the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant and the land storage tank, and the polluted water of the shielding facility is transported to the land storage tank by the pipeline, thereby reducing the water level in the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, when the sea water purification facility 120 can not process all of the contaminated water even though the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a predetermined reference value due to a large difference between heavy rain, heavy rain or tide water, and transports the polluted water to the land-based storage tank 140 through the first pipeline 150"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the control unit 180 controls the driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump 170 to bypass the contaminated water to the land storage tank 140 when the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a predetermined reference value"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "for example, in the case of the domestic west coast, the polluted water is transported to the land-based storage tank 140 through the polluted water storage tank 130, thereby indicating that the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 can be lowered"}]</data>
