ants"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101313936-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "naturally, the lower spigot 208 interlocked with the float opens, and after a certain period of time, the rainwater stored in the initial excellent tank is completely discharged to prevent decay due to the residue and to prepare for the next rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101316530-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, conventionally, when rainwater does not flow into the rainwater storage tank, there is a difficulty in treating the boiling point contaminants due to the decay of the stored water while the rainwater stays in the rainwater storage tank for a long time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the conventional early rainwater treatment device has a problem that the residual water remaining in the treatment tank easily decays because (cause) the rainwater is filled up from the bottom to the height of the outlet even when the rainwater is stopped"}]</data>
