e due to leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, during rain, the initial rainwater containing non-point pollutants introduced into the manhole can be drained to the sewage treatment plant through sewage pipes to reduce the contamination of the rivers by the non-point pollutants as well as inflow after the initial rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300524-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it can be inserted and inserted into the body to provide a pipe connection structure with a simple structure, and furthermore, it is possible to prevent soil contamination due to leakage of rainwater through securing watertightness, as well as to reduce the time and cost required for the reconstruction of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flows along the pipeline during the supply or discharge of rainwater, thereby minimizing contamination due to the propagation of microorganisms in the rainwater by maintaining uniform time of stagnation in the rainwater storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100584236-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "thus, when rainwater is concentrated on the catchment surface 2 in which contamination by contaminants is prevented early by the titanium dioxide photocatalyst layer, the rainwater is transferred to the storage tank 1 through the catchment port 3 and stored"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101101703-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "according to the present invention, it is possible to effectively purify the rainwater having a high degree of contamination, and to variably mount the biostone storage means by the rack and the rack support frame, thereby simplifying the installation and removal in the filtration tank and the long-term rainwater filtration"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flows along the pipeline during the supply or discharge of rainwater, thereby minimizing contamination due