  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102408952-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, it is possible to block the supply of river water or seawater backflowing to the stormwater chamber 110 to the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "US-9580899-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, such end wall panels 82 act as a boundary block around the perimeter of the storm pod structure 10 and function to aid corresponding liquid retention chambers 76 in retaining the liquid or overflow water stored therein"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100795399-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the stormwater manager regularly checks the slope screen bar (4) and sand sedimentation chamber (5) of the stormwater chamber and periodically removes contaminants and sand by manpower"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101926744-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the pollutant screening net 20 removes contaminants contained in the storm water flowing into the excellent stormwater chamber 11 from the outside and guides the contaminants to the contaminant discharge chamber 12 through the stormwater collecting chamber 11, a space is formed between the water collecting chamber 11 and the upper portion of the pollutant discharge chamber 12 and between the second partition 12a and the pollutant discharge chamber 12"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101879690-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the stormwater inflow pipe 11 is arranged on the ceiling portion above the discharge chamber 14 of the collecting tank 10 and the discharge pipe 12 is arranged on the bottom portion of the discharge chamber 14 therefore, the stormwater flowing through the storm inflow pipe 11 is quickly discharged through the discharge pipe 12 when the initial storm water is excluded, and the initial stormwater with high contamination degree is discharged to the buoyancy chamber 15 )"}, {"pat_id": "US-8297880-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, because of their different use, storm chambers lack a multiplicity of small perforations in the sidewall, which necessarily characterize leaching chambers and weaken a sidewall"}]</data>
