ion applied in vertical and horizontal directions due to ground subsidence or external impact, or sinking or flow of the valve chamber 20 occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102529136-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the internal pipe 10 or the external pipe 30 is distorted by vibration applied in vertical and horizontal directions due to ground subsidence or external impact, or sinking or flow of the valve chamber 20 occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101054501-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in the process of installing the water pipe or water meter, it is naturally installed in accordance with the horizontal standard.however, ground subsidence occurs during use, or external impact factors such as vehicle traffic cause one end of the water pipe or water meter to be flush with the other"}]</data>
