e drainage from the building causes pressure buildup between the municipal sewer and the building, putting the building at risk of a backwater flood"}, {"pat_id": "US-11560697-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the drainage line becomes clogged or blocked with debris, ice, or as a result of build-up inside the pipe, a flooding event can occur in the building if adequate precautions are not taken"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention, by installing a buoyancy blocking device 130 is operated by buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom surface of the rainwater inlet 113 of the manhole 110 to block the inlet 113, the rainwater from the original while performing the function of, the guerrilla torrential rain, flooding due to the backflow of sewage due to the flood effect is to be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101841645-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the diameter of the water hole 311 formed in the block housing 30 is smaller than the diameter of the inlet hole 21 formed in the press plate 20, the number of the holes 311 is formed in the block housing 30 in a smaller number than the number of the inlet holes 21 formed in the press plate 20 so that the gap between the inlet holes 21 of the block housing 30 is discharged to the permeable hole (311) in a state of being filled with water, thereby preventing flooding or flooding due to abrupt discharge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention, by installing a buoyancy blocking device 130 is operated by buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom surface of the rainwater inlet 113 of the manhole 110 to block the inlet 113, the rainwater from the original while performing the function of, the guerrilla torrential rain, flooding due to the backflow of sewage due to the flood effect is to be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200495876-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention,