id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, in the present invention, the removal of contaminants is actively performed on the road drainage during the initial rainfall stage in which the content of the pollutants is high, and the filter filling tank 71 considering the low amount of pollutants in the subsequent road drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100750645-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "these storm receivers store the road drainage during rainfall and transfer it to the filtration apparatus to adsorb and remove contaminants contained in the road drainage, and then discharge only the treated water to the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100750645-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the amount of contaminants in the road surface drainage due to the subsequent rainfall is small, and it can be said that there is little problem even if the excess water is discharged immediately without passing through the filtration tank 54"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200343186-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention actively removes contaminants from the road drainage during the initial rainfall stage with a large amount of pollutants, and considers that the content of the pollutants in the subsequent road drainage is low"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200357071-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention actively removes contaminants from the road drainage during the initial rainfall stage with a high content of contaminants, and considers that the content of the contaminants is low in the subsequent road drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200358330-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention actively removes contaminants from road surface drainage during the initial rainfall stage with high content of contaminants, and the contaminant content is less for road drainage than the treatment capacity in the subsequent treatment tank 20"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102335129-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, the conventional slope structure simply performs a drainage function to prevent collapse, and even if the inflow of polluted river water or polluted water due to rainfall flows into the interior of the slope structure, it cannot be purified and discharged, and there is a problem that may cause soil contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in this way, the pollutants deposited on the road are transported to the road drainage due to rainfall, flowed into the sewer, and then discharged to the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, the pollutants deposited on the road surface are sequentially transported by road drainage due to rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, the removal process of pollutants deposited on the road surface is almost completed in the initial rainfall stage, and since the amount of pollutants in the road drainage due to the subsequent rainfall remains small, the road drainage does not come into contact with the media installed in the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200343186-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this way, the pollutants deposited on the road are transported to the road drainage due to rainfall, flowed into the sewers, and then discharged to the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200343186-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the above structure can increase the treatment efficiency of high concentration pollutants drained through the road during the initial rainfall stage, but if it exceeds the treatment capacity of the maintenance tank due to the sudden rainfall, various pollutants deposited on the road are maintained"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200343186-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as described above, the removal process of the pollutants deposited on the road surface is almost completed in the initial rainfall stage, and since the amount of the pollutants in the road drainage due to the subsequent rainfall remains small, the road drainage is applied to the media installed in the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200357071-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this way, the pollutants deposited on the road are transported to the road drainage due to rainfall, flowed into the sewer, and then discharged to the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200357071-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the pollutants deposited on the road surface are sequentially transported by road drainage due to rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200357071-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the removal process of pollutants deposited on the road surface is almost completed in the initial rainfall stage, and since the amount of pollutants in the road drainage due to the subsequent rainfall remains small, the road drainage does not come into contact with the media installed in the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200358330-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as described above, the road surface drainage treatment apparatus having an initial excellent filtration function according to the present invention has a road drainage capacity capable of smoothly draining the road drainage increased during rainfall, and is deposited on the road surface"}]</data>
