 present invention also provides a device for continuously removing foreign matter flowing into a drainage channel together with rainwater, thereby preventing a flooding caused by blocking the drainage port with foreign matter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102016628-B1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "can rotate thus, by the auxiliary weight 115 alone, or by the combination of the auxiliary weight 115 and the compression spring 116, the drainage is normally closed to block the bad smell backflow, when the inflow of rainwater increases the guide plate 113 may be rotated to further open the drain hole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102058438-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "that is, the present invention adopts the principle that the foreign matter blocking function and the rainwater discharge function are switched in response to the weather change, and thus it is possible to solve all of the inconvenience caused by the odor, the drainage obstacle due to the inflow of foreign matter, and the secondary damage caused by this"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102079279-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "even in this case, the rainwater drainage port 62 is blocked by contaminants and is not drained, and thus the rainwater guide unit 50 cannot return to the first position p1, and thus the rainwater containing the contaminants may not be excluded at the next rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102079736-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, in the case of the existing urban waterway system including the prior art, because (cause) the rainwater must be passed through the vegetation and the block to the drainage passage, the permeation rate is very slow, there is a problem that the periphery of the vegetation is submerged"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102200449-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result, it is possible to block in advance that the waste remaining without being sucked penetrates into the drainage channel along with rainwater, etc., ultimately contaminating the sewage treatment plant, and thus, it is possible 