ention is to provide a rainwater drainage drainage that is provided with a blockage preventing means and a water removal means of the sediment, which prevents the rainwater from being clogged by the sediment at the source and also easily removes the sediment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200391152-Y1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "it is possible to secure the strength, and because (cause) the drain pipe is normally blocked by the odor backflow installed in the drain pipe, it is possible to block the odor backflow from the sewage main pipe to the rainwater receiving side"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200398817-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the vinyl bag may be covered on the grating of the drain to prevent the backflow of the odor, but in case of sudden rain, the vinyl bag may block the drain of the rainwater, which may prevent the rainwater from draining and cause a safety accident due to the rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200403834-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, the sewage and rainwater flowing along the road surface 1 in the state in which the floating block 20 is seated on the lid 11 flows to the drainage block 10 via the drainage hole 21 and the lid 11"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100772481-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, since the rainwater penetrates into the surrounding ground directly from the rainwater infiltration drainage hole, the blockage occurs due to sand contained in the rainwater being stored in the rainwater infiltration drainage hole, and the penetration capability is lowered due to the blockage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102599308-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "in cases where the drainage function is lost due to blockage by various foreign substances, rainwater whose water level rises due to poor drainage treatment can be safely bypassed and treated to prevent flooding damage due to rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200328168-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention was devised to solve the general problems of the aforementioned conventional warfare, the object of the present invention is to provide a rainwater drainage drainage that is provided with a blockage preventing means and a water removal means of the sediment, which prevents the rainwater from being clogged by the sediment at the source and also easily removes the sediment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200448229-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the above-described invention is effective for blocking odor and drainage, but it is necessary to discharge the water in the sewage pipe to the outside in order to prevent breakage of the sewage pipe when the rainwater is filled with rainwater and the pressure is applied to the sewage pipe due to heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101275853-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, as described above, since the initial rainwater does not have a relatively large flow rate, the water level in the drainage passage 10 is low, thereby bypassing the main body portion 100, and the sustained rainwater bypasses the main body portion 100 because of the large flow rate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101275854-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, as described above, since the initial rainwater does not have a relatively large flow rate, the water level in the drainage passage 10 is low, thereby bypassing the main body portion 100, and the sustained rainwater bypasses the main body portion 100 because of the large flow rate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flowing in the valley or the drainage channel of the retaining wall is suddenly flowed by the heavy rain, and the flowing velocity is a reality that there is a high risk of erosion or collapse of the soil"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101519076-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result, the rainwater flowing in the valleys and the drainage channels is suddenly blown up by heavy rainfall, and the flow velocity is a real danger of erosion or collapse of the soil"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100823240-B1", "para_id": "par