ed by the cyclone phenomenon to be deposited in the storm drain pipe 12"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101822469-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "further, since the initial stormwater treatment apparatus and the drain port 100 can be easily attached and detached, the effect of facilitating the removal of foreign substances deposited in the initial stormwater treatment apparatus is added"}, {"pat_id": "US-10927539-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the costs for hauling clean water to storm drain conduit cleaning sites and for hauling away dirty water and the materials removed from the storm drain conduits are significant"}, {"pat_id": "US-10927539-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such trucks can also present problems for traffic in the vicinity and can cause undesirable wear and tear on streets and highways where storm drain conduits are being cleaned"}, {"pat_id": "US-10927539-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such trucks can also present problems for traffic in the vicinity and can cause undesirable wear and tear on streets and highways where storm drain conduits are being cleaned"}]</data>
