  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100612249-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, this precipitation method is difficult to neutralize the acid rain, and the quality of the stored rainwater is worse because the decay begins when the particles are small or floating contaminants or microorganisms mixed in the rainwater into the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100937004-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention of the above-described configuration is disposed on the reservoir water and subjected to the electrolysis and electrocoagulation treatment, the precipitation treatment, and the microbial treatment and the vegetation filtration decomposition of the green algae propagated water, thereby completely eliminating the green algae remaining in the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100937004-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, because no chemicals are used to remove the algae in the water, secondary pollution is not generated by the treated water returned to the reservoir, and the water treatment is purely electrolysis and electrocoagulation, precipitation, biochemical treatment by microorganisms, and aquatic life"}]</data>
