  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100826575-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention detects an abnormality such as tension and breakage of the chain in the torque sensor of the hydraulic cylinder and sends a signal to the control unit, if there is an abnormality in the tension amount, operates the hydraulic unit to supply hydraulic pressure to the hydraulic cylinder to operate the chain tension of the lifting part"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101406507-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, although the present invention is equipped with a pressure sensor for detecting a hydraulic pressure drop occurring when a water pipe leaks, and an acoustic sensor for detecting a sound wave generated when a water pipe leaks, a compact arrangement is possible, and a sound / pressure composite sensor which prevents excessive increase of the temperature of the leaked water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100826575-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention detects an abnormality such as tension and breakage of the chain in the torque sensor of the hydraulic cylinder and sends a signal to the control unit, if there is an abnormality in the tension amount, operates the hydraulic unit to supply hydraulic pressure to the hydraulic cylinder to operate the chain tension of the lifting part"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100826575-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the tension measurement value of the chain 135 output from the torque sensor 172 of the chain tension correction means 170 decreases based on the initial setting value, it is determined that the chain is sagging and the hydraulic unit 173 is operated to operate the hydraulic pressure"}]</data>
</edge>
