": "KR-100531027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the rainfall and the level of rainwater and sewage in the sump tank 150 increases, the water level in the guide groove 141 is also increased to raise the lifting height of the buoyancy member 122"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100531031-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the rainfall and the level of rainwater and sewage in the sump tank 150 increases, the water level in the guide groove 141 is also increased to raise the lifting height of the buoyancy member 122"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101730962-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the drain assembly may be located near the sump bottom to reduce scaling on the evaporator / condenser inner tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102081866-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the drain assembly may be located near the sump bottom to reduce scaling on the evaporator / condenser inner tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100681933-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the vertical void outflow facility to be installed in a tank or the like is provided with a strainer settled on a base made of steel or the like, attaching a sump bucket 90 at the lower part of the filter settled cylinder 31, and connecting the discharge pipe 91 to the sump bucket 90"}]</data>
