  <data key="d5">["connection", "water", "panel", "time", "leak", "problem", "storage", "load", "energy", "function", "damper", "waterproofing", "wall", "breakage", "portion", "deformation", "tube", "consideration", "construction", "case", "ground", "body", "plurality", "embodiment", "aquarium", "unit", "material", "tank", "cracking", "invention", "example", "plastic", "damage", "contact", "side", "part", "settlement", "capacity", "vibration", "concrete", "characteristic", "layer", "earthquake", "leakage", "strength", "life"]</data>
  <data key="d6">["cause", "exceed", "extend", "induce", "crack", "add", "lose", "describe", "occur", "age", "prevent", "absorb", "predetermine", "achieve", "flow", "transmit", "instal", "select", "have", "make", "perform", "determine", "use", "form", "break", "be"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the present embodiment, predetermined seismic load is selected in consideration of the material and the capacity of the water tank 5, and for example, when the vibration energy of water is added to the predetermined earthquake load by an earthquake load, it can be determined by the strength of an earthquake that may cause deformation, breakage, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101837911-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "as described above, if the vibration due to the earthquake is absorbed, breakage or damage of the water tank can be prevented, and thus the life of the water tank can be extended"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100653866-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a concrete tank has a problem in that the cracking occurs over time due to the characteristics of concrete even if the waterproofing is thoroughly performed during construction, and in particular, there is a problem of cracking in case of uneven settlement of the ground and an earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100653866-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention thus achieved by forming a storage tank using a plurality of tubes, first, the construction is simple and quick, and there is no cracking caused by uneven settlement or earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the present embodiment, predetermined seismic load is selected in consideration of the material and the capacity of the water tank 5, and for example, when the vibration energy of water is added to the predetermined earthquake load by an earthquake load, it can be determined by the strength of an earthquake that may cause deformation, breakage, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "5, a plurality of dampers 10 are formed on a side of the water tank 5 which is in contact with the ground, and a plurality of dampers 10 are installed when a seismic load exceeds a predetermined seismic load, and an earthquake load is transmitted to induce plastic deformation"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3906965-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "furthermore, if the aquarium itself is aged, the tank wall made of concrete may crack due to earthquakes and leak water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101837911-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, in the case of an immovable settlement caused by an earthquake or the like, there is a problem that the connection between the panels is broken, and leakage occurs in the broken part, thereby losing the function as a water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, the present invention is a useful invention that can prevent water leakage from occurring when the lower portions of the unit panels 22 of the lowermost layer of the water tank body 2 flow outward when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "5, a plurality of dampers 10 are formed on a side of the water tank 5 which is in contact with the ground, and a plurality of dampers 10 are installed when a seismic load exceeds a predetermined seismic load, and an earthquake load is transmitted to induce plastic deformation"}]</data>
</edge>
