he reaction catalyst for promoting the oxidation reaction in addition to the oxidizing agent"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102344740-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "maintaining the temperature of the purified water flowing into and stored in the purified water tank unit 1100 by the anti-freezing heater unit 1600 at any one temperature selected from the range of 27 to 75 degrees celsius is to promote the activation of the advanced oxidation process (aop)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200454214-Y1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a heat exchanger provided with a coil or plate type softening line to increase the temperature of soft water by heat exchange between soft water supplied from a softener and sodium hypochlorite flowing from the electrolysis tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200454214-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a heat exchanger provided with a coil or plate type softening line to increase the temperature of soft water by heat exchange between soft water supplied from a softener and sodium hypochlorite flowing from the electrolysis tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101519389-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "when the dehydrated cake, the additive, and the moisture control agent (swelling agent) are mixed in the mixer 500 and supplied to the fermentation tank 503 of the fermentation process in the primary dehydration process and the secondary dehydration process, co 2 , h 2 o, and nh 3 , the temperature increases to 60-70 c due to the heat of reaction"}]</data>
