rol is performed to relatively increase the amount of water transferred by the advection pump 122, and the contamination level is also increased"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101388033-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in the present embodiment, since the sensing unit 58 that detects the water level of the sewage is installed outside the tank 30, the sensing unit 58 may be prevented from malfunctioning due to severe contamination of the sensing unit 58"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102434590-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the end part is immersed in the water level of undischarged sewage that always remains in the storage state in the sewage tank, so that the negative effects such as contamination of indoor air due to odors during the sewage discharge operation can be eliminated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102436761-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the end part is immersed in the water level of undischarged sewage that always remains in the storage state in the sewage tank, so that the negative effects such as contamination of indoor air due to odors during the sewage discharge operation can be eliminated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "(f2 f3) accordingly, in the present invention, the amount of water stored in the water tank is automatically adjusted to a level higher than the water level capable of detecting a wind speed (wind load) this is to prevent defects due to wind loads such as overturning and partial crushing of the water tank due to insufficient amount of water stored in the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100331066-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by equaling the water level in groups, the concrete capacity of decaying tanks is reduced and the simultaneous treatment efficiency is maximized"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101383594-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and according to the variable level screen filter according to the present invention, it is possible to support the variable screen unit in connection with the water tank to improve the dur