  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100706118-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to this replenishment, when the water level in the brine reservoir 5 reaches the upper limit, the electric valve 11 is automatically closed to block the supply of water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101044802-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water level in the brine reservoir 5 reaches the upper limit due to the water supply and replenishment, the electric valve 11 is automatically closed to block the supply of direct water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101051656-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, water is supplied from the water storage container to the spray generator through the water supply valve, and when an appropriate amount of water is supplied to the spray generator, the water level control means rises by buoyancy and blocks the water supply valve so that water is no longer sprayed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101588396-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, when the float valve 16 is closed by the buoy 17, the water level of the dirt increases due to the dirt that flows into the dirt collection vehicle, thereby blocking the movement of the air and further preventing the dirt from being introduced into the collection vehicle"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102400040-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the water level of the treated water tank is measured in real time, and when the water level is out of a certain range, the gate valve is selectively opened and closed to block the flow path of the overflow pipe, thereby increasing the overflow height of the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200332116-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, when the water tank level is a high water level, the flow of water is blocked by the float 42 and the pressure valve 43, so that the current of the pump motor increases without being stabilized as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200442330-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically, when the purified water is filled to the water level set in the purified water storage tank (pressure tank), the automatic shut off valve for the water purification system can automatically block the inflow of raw water to the purified water filter due to the pressure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101578433-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water level sensor senses water flowing into the sterilization lamp due to breakage of the sterilization lamp, is configured to actuate the inlet valve to close the inlet tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101578433-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the water level sensor senses water flowing into the sterilizing lamp due to breakage of the sterilizing lamp, the controller 140 operates the inlet valve 150 to close the inlet tube, so as not to be supplied"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100644949-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "water purifier automatic drainage method of another embodiment of the present invention, the water level check step of detecting the water level of the water tank to determine the number of water, the step of determining the number of water to be confirmed for a certain time, and if a predetermined number or more is confirmed, drainage of the water tank and opening the valve and draining the water, determining whether the water level is confirmed within a predetermined time, checking the water level when the water level is confirmed, and draining the water by opening the water drain valve of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100644949-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "third, when the water level is confirmed for a predetermined number of times or more, a drainage step of opening and draining the drain valve of the refrigerant tank, determining whether the water level is confirmed within a predetermined time, and a water level checking step of checking the water level when the water level is confirmed as a result, errors due to internal factors can be recognized"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101569048-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, corrosion and rust- thereby preventing the deterioration of the life of the wiping valve.1 is a longitudinal sectional view of an installation state of a water level shield according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100938251-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the first valve 500 and the second valve 600 are opened or closed at the same time, respectively, and received the displacement measured from the sludge detection unit 700 to determine whether there is deposition, and flows into the interior by the water level sensor 900"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200454214-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "another object of the present invention is to maintain a constant water level using a float valve and to supply a constant concentration of brine to the electrolysis tank so that sodium hypochlorite is equipped with an automatic valve and a flow sensor to produce a constant concentration of sodium hypochlorite it is to provide a generator"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200454214-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as such, by maintaining the water level at all times using the float valve 131, the suction pressure of saturated brine can be kept constant, and a constant concentration of salt water can be supplied to the electrolysis tank to produce sodium hypochlorite of a constant concentration"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall as well as between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, the leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall, so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the automatic water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall, and between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, a leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall as well as between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, the leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall, so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the automatic water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall, and between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, a leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101569048-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, corrosion and rust- thereby preventing the deterioration of the life of the wiping valve.1 is a longitudinal sectional view of an installation state of a water level shield according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3347959-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "[0003] in a vacuum valve unit of this type of vacuum type sewer system, when a sewage water level abnormality of a sewage tank occurs due to a vacuum valve failure or the like, it is necessary to quickly detect this and notify a manager"}]</data>
