  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200177676-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when freezing and raining due to the rainy season or weather changes in summer, rainwater has been introduced into the water meter protection tank, which has been a cause of oxidation and corrosion of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200315485-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, it is possible to prevent the insulation cap 2 from being rotted due to the rainwater flowing into the water meter protection container, or the occurrence of corrosion and the malfunction caused by the water meter 3"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "can occur in particular, when the water meter is installed underground, it is difficult to completely prevent freezing of the water meter in winter because it is vulnerable to the inflow of moisture, groundwater, and rainwater from underground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, in order to sufficiently prevent freezing of the water meter, a method capable of blocking the inflow of moisture, groundwater, rainwater, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "by means of the above solution, the present invention protects the water meter from physical factors such as external environment or impact and at the same time blocks the inflow of moisture, groundwater, rainwater, etc., thereby sufficiently preventing freezing of the water meter in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200177676-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when freezing and raining due to the rainy season or weather changes in summer, rainwater has been introduced into the water meter protection tank, which has been a cause of oxidation and corrosion of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200177676-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when freezing and raining due to the rainy season or weather changes in summer, rainwater has been introduced into the water meter protection tank, which has been a cause of oxidation and corrosion of the water meter"}]</data>
