  <data key="d6">["cause", "provide", "rotate", "read", "introduce", "equip", "attach", "send", "pass", "drop", "check", "change", "localize", "inspect", "set", "crack", "fall", "receive", "characterize", "accord", "save", "accommodate", "lose", "describe", "occur", "melt", "burst", "include", "predict", "influence", "show", "base", "interrupt", "allow", "block", "reach", "reduce", "case", "go down", "solve", "maintain", "heat", "utilize", "install", "prevent", "communicate", "configure", "supply", "infringe", "inhibit", "connect", "thermosette", "break down", "increase", "incorporate", "expose", "flow", "turn", "damage", "mitigate", "freeze", "publish", "instal", "insert", "have", "decrease", "expand", "relieve", "make", "determine", "improve", "use", "detect", "relate", "be"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100886893-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water metering box protective casing cap is installed in a protective casing because it cannot block the ground temperature during the cold winter season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101568929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101861841-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102683498-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "however, since water meters as described above must be checked or inspected frequently, they are generally installed outdoors rather than indoors, so it is not uncommon for them to easily freeze and burst due to low temperatures in the winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101568929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101568929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the protective box 10 is configured to be able to prevent a frost caused by a temperature change due to an external impact and a season while accommodating the water meter m so as to accommodate a thermosetting material such as styrofoam although it is not shown inside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101861841-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100518072-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in addition, there is no fear of freezing of the water meter because (cause) the water meter not only rotates during the flow of water but also freezes the water at low temperatures"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100722480-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "recently, in order to prevent the water meter from freezing due to a sudden drop in temperature, the internal air is directly inserted into the water meter storage box 100 or the water meter protection tube 200 so that external air is directly connected to the water meter 300"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101214677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the second support 250 may not only prevent the water meter 10 itself from freezing or freezing due to winter outdoor temperature, but also may be made of transparent glass so that the number of the display unit 220 can be easily read"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "receiving temperature information of the water flowing through the water pipe from the smart water meter, receiving outdoor temperature information from the meteorological server, and determining whether a water meter is in danger of freezing in accordance with the temperature information of the water in the water pipes and the outside temperature information, if the water meter determines that there is a risk of freezing waves, it provides a freeze prevention system of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "is provided with outdoor temperature information from the water pipes, and judges whether the water meter is in danger of freezing in accordance with the water temperature information of the water pipes and the outside temperature information, and if it is determined that the water meter is in danger of freezing, to the user wire / wireless terminal of the water meter it provides a management server, characterized in that to send a freezing warning"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101369585-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in recent years, the temperature drop sharply occurs especially due to the abnormal temperature, and this causes the water meter freezing frequency to increase significantly"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101404540-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when there is a risk of freezing of the water meter m due to a drop in winter temperature and a rapid drop in the temperature of the tap water, the temperature of the heating wire w can be detected from the temperature information detected by the temperature sensor 100 and the flow rate information detected by the flow sensor 200, or not"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the conventional water meter, due to the icing of the inside of the winter casing having a low temperature, frequent occurrence of freezing accidents occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-0926266.the present invention relates to a water meter which is capable of reducing the expansion pressure caused by the freezing of the interior of a winter casing having a low temperature in a prior art water meter, thereby remarkably decreasing the functionality and durability of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the elastic cover 50 is a function of preventing the frost accident of the water meter by relieving the inflation pressure due to the freezing of the inside of the winter casing 10 having a low temperature, as shown in figs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, when the inside of the winter casing having a low temperature is frozen, , the expansion pressure due to freezing is sufficiently mitigated, thereby preventing the accident of the water meter from being frozen"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101528163-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this water meter is exposed to the outside for easy access to check the amount of water meter, so when the outside temperature goes down to freezing in winter, the water meter breaks down due to the frozen wave and sometimes the function is lost"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101542382-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-2004-0013366 (published on february 14, 2004) in embodiments of the present invention, tap water flows automatically so that the water meter can not be frozen when the water reaches a temperature at which the water inside the water meter can be frozen even if the user does not use tap water, thereby preventing freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101568929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101861841-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it provides the effect of (cause) preventing freezing of water meters by introducing geothermal heat higher than the temperature into the protective tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2 is an operation diagram showing a color change according to a temperature change of the freezing wave prediction temperature sheet 150 in the water meter 100 equipped with a freezing temperature prediction sheet according to an embodiment of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the water meter 100 provided with the freezing wave prediction sheet according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction temperature sheet 150 has a second set temperature (eg, -5 degrees) that is lower than the first set temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the water meter 100 equipped with the freezing wave prediction sheet according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction temperature sheet 150 has a first color at a first set temperature (for example, 0 degrees celsius) or more"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to detect a color change based on the temperature of tap water, it is provided (strictly attached) to the outer shell 110 of the water meter 100, and the freezing prediction temperature sheet 150 includes the water meter 100"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in the water meter 100 equipped with a freezing sheet for predicting a freezing wave according to an embodiment of the present invention, the second zion region 152 is equal to or less than a second set temperature (eg, -5 degrees c)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "4 is an operation diagram showing a color change according to a temperature change of the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 in the freezing wave prediction water meter system according to an embodiment of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the freeze prediction sheet 150 is characterized in that the color changes according to the temperature of the outside air in which the water meter 100 is installed, so that the user can directly check the possibility of freezing of the water meter 100"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the freezing wave prediction water meter system according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 is a water meter 100 in order to change color based on the temperature of tap water passing through the fluid passage hole 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "7, in the freezing wave prediction water meter system according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 is color based on the temperature of the tap water passing through the fluid passage hole 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102263501-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "water meter freeze protection cover freezing protection cover for water meter the present disclosure relates to a water meter freeze protection cover, and more particularly, to a water meter freeze protection cover for preventing the water meter from freezing due to a decrease in external temperature in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102300746-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this traditional method has a disadvantage in that it is not effective in preventing freezing of the water meter and water pipe due to the problem of thermal insulation when the external temperature is very low below -5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102346405-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a temporary measure has difficulty in preventing freezing of the water meter and water pipe due to the thermal insulation problem when the external temperature is very low below -5 c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102466363-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in general, when the outside temperature drops below freezing, such as in winter, the water flowing inside the main body of the water meter freezes and expands, and the expansion force may cause a freeze phenomenon that damages the glass cover of the meter or damages the meter itself"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102725459-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "however, as water meters like the above need to be checked or inspected regularly, they are usually installed outdoors rather than indoors, so they are prone to freezing due to low temperatures in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200230541-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to this problem, the supply of tap water is interrupted during the winter, and the tap water has to be supplied after melting the tap with hot water or heat.if the temperature drops too much, the water meter freezes due to the freezing of the water meter due to rapid freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200266383-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it prevents water meter from freezing even during the cold winter season, and it saves much manpower and time due to reconstruction.when it is used for a long time, the protection box is cracked or damaged due to earth pressure or temperature change"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200307663-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "to solve the problem of excessive input of metering manpower and metering time due to the use of meter box and freezing of water meter which is easy to occur due to external temperature drop, the function was improved"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200310432-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "above all, freezing occurs due to a decrease in the external temperature of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200372345-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if you install the water meter outside the building as described above, there is an advantage that the meter reading staff can easily read, and the privacy is not infringed during the metering process, but it is installed outdoors in the winter season where the freezing is low due to the low outside temperature this will provide a cause for freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200373667-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, if the water meter is exposed to freezing temperatures below zero in winter, the water inside the water meter expands due to the water freezing inside, and thus freezing occurs in the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200387639-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, warm geothermal heat is introduced in the winter season, so that the temperature inside the water meter protector can maintain a temperature similar to that of the geothermal temperature, thereby preventing freezing of water meters and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200415979-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, since water meters installed in buildings such as apartment complexes are installed in corridors that are not heated, they are easily influenced by temperature and are easily frozen when the temperature drops sharply, thus exposing more of them to the risk of freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200487219-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this water meter 10, tap water is allowed to pass through the water meter, so that when the air temperature falls below freezing in winter, tap water passing through the water meter is frozen, and thus the water meter 10 is frequently frozen"}, {"pat_id": "US-11095960-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11095960-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "thus, a single set of localized sensors (flow rate sensor 105, optional pressure sensor 65, optional acoustic sensor, and/or optional temperature sensor 93) can be utilized and incorporated into the water meter and leak detection system 10 (126 shown in figs"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11095960-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "thus, a single set of localized sensors (flow rate sensor 105, optional pressure sensor 65, optional acoustic sensor, and/or optional temperature sensor 93) can be utilized and incorporated into the water meter and leak detection system 10 (126 shown in figs"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}]</data>
</edge>
